; A BIND DNS zone, which has owned this extension since long before zoning existed.
; It sits where a contract now sits, so identity cannot be the extension: a sweep that
; parsed every `*.zone` would fail this repository's build over its nameserver data.
$TTL 3600
$ORIGIN example.com.
@   IN  SOA ns1.example.com. hostmaster.example.com. ( 1 3600 600 604800 3600 )
@   IN  NS  ns1.example.com.
ns1 IN  A   192.0.2.1
